SUMMARY:Social Hills Half
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Julie Slack\n\nPlanning on ticking the Strava July Half
  Marathon Challenge? Fancy a longer outing? You are welcome to join me for 
 all\, or some\, of a Malvern Hills Half route. \nI think this will take 2 3
 /4 - 3 hours. Below are estimated times for 'jump on' locations. \n\n08:00 
  go south from BC on lower trails\n08:30 head up from the Wyche bus stop to
  the Worcestershire Beacon\, head round the back of North Hill coming round
  past Westminster Bank to take lower trails back to the Wyche\n9:40 ish tak
 e the eastern lower trails back down to BC\n10:15 ish head south to the ram
 parts and possibly the Herefordshire Beacon to complete the 21.1k distance.
  \n\nRefreshments in the Malvern Hills Hotel. \n\nI'm happy to drop anybody
  back at the Wyche after I have had a cup of coffee!  \n\nPlease come prepa
 red with water and nutrition as required for the run. \n\nIf you click in w
 ith a plan to participate in only some of the route please message me to le
 t me  know. \n\nLiRF: Julie S [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: ht
 tps://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3513612690200334268\n\nSynce
 d from Strava Club 208705 on Sat\, 25 Jul @ 12:40 AM
